== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @arborio rice{2/5%cup}, @parmesan cheese{1/10%cup}, @olive oil{1%tsp}, @roma tomato{1/2}, @sugar{1/4%tsp}, @lemon{1/2}, @gluten-free chicken stock concentrate{1/2}, @butter{3/2%tbsp}, @zucchini{1/2}, @italian venison sausage{9/2%oz}, @tuscan heat spice{1/2%tbsp}, @pepper{3/2%tbsp}, @yellow onion{1/2}.

== Preparation ==

Prepare ingredients and any grains or vegetable sides.

Cook protein using an appropriate method until safe doneness, then combine with prepared sauce and garnishes.
